CLI frontend for cloak — redact secrets and PII from streams

Usage: cloak [OPTIONS] [FILES]...

Arguments:
  [FILES]...  Input files. If omitted, reads stdin

Options:
      --config <CONFIG>        Path to a TOML configuration file
      --stats-format <FORMAT>  Emit per-rule match statistics to stderr [possible values: text, json]
  -h, --help                   Print help
  -V, --version                Print version
